# Snitch soft risograph design system

Locked aesthetic for marketing, legal, and product UI. Do not invent a second look.

## Direction

Soft, inky, slightly imperfect **risograph** print feel - zine / editorial poster energy.

- Limited spot inks on warm print paper (not stiff SaaS, not neon cyber)
- Visible **halftone / grain**, slight **misregistration**, flat ink fills, paper show-through
- Photography treated as printed (duotone / halftone overlay), not glossy photo chrome
- **Yellow-forward** accent system (mustard / fluorescent riso yellow, not gold luxury chrome)
- **Logo mark**: Lovable-style cartoon mascot (white coat, black sunglasses, yellow hat-band accents) - favicon and wordmark companion
- **Hero / illustration**: same cartoon mascot (peek + binos variants) on landing; charcoal detective silhouette may still appear in 404 / empty polaroid art if present
- Winged orb / "Harry Potter snitch" mark is **retired** as brand chrome (asset may remain on disk; do not use in UI). Not HP merchandise art.

## Tokens (CSS)

Defined in `resources/css/app.css`:

- `--snitch-paper` `#EFE6D8` (warm uncoated stock)
- `--snitch-ink` `#1C1B1A` (charcoal)
- `--snitch-spot` / `--snitch-accent` / `--snitch-marker` `#F0C400` (strong riso yellow / mustard)
- `--snitch-teal` `#3A5F6B` (optional third mist for teal stamps only)
- `--snitch-halftone`, `--snitch-grain`, ticket clip for buttons
- Display: **Young Serif** (print/zine); body: **Figtree**; annotation: **Caveat**

## Craft utilities

- `.snitch-surface` / `.snitch-app-shell` - paper + halftone ground
- `.snitch-btn` - torn-ticket / overprinted ink block with yellow misreg shadow (not rounded SaaS rect)
- `.snitch-stamp` - real ink stamp with offset shadow; active stamps fill yellow with charcoal type
- `.snitch-scrap`, `.snitch-polaroid`, `.snitch-contact-sheet`, `.snitch-sticker`, `.snitch-tear-board`, `.snitch-cutout`, `.snitch-doc`
- Brand misregistration: duplicate yellow layer offset under Young Serif wordmark

## Look

- Brand-first full-bleed riso poster hero with detective mascots; one headline, one line, one CTA group
- Nav over hero: absolute, paper-on-print contrast
- Feed cells like printed contact sheets; stamps as ink stamps
- Analysis as annotation stickers; winners as tear-sheet board
- Motion: grain drift, tape settle, contact-sheet reveal - soft presence

## Avoid

- Purple SaaS gradients / neon cyber glow / glossy 3D AI desk
- Cream + terracotta corporate cliche (paper may be warm; spot is yellow ink, not terracotta UI chrome)
- Coral / pink as primary accent (retired; do not reintroduce as brand spot)
- Gold luxury chrome or metallic yellow
- Stiff Fraunces + Instrument Sans pairing, Inter / Roboto / Arial / system
- Generic rounded-rectangle buttons and pill badges
- Card stacks in the hero; "Laravel Starter Kit" placeholders
- Baked-in wordmarks or gibberish UI text in generated assets when HTML owns brand type
- Winged snitch orb as logo / favicon / nav mark (retired)
- Charcoal silhouette detective as logo / favicon / nav mark (illustration only)

## Canva brief

- Soft risograph: charcoal + mustard yellow on cream paper, halftone, misregistration
- Logo slots: Lovable-style cartoon mascot mark (white coat, sunglasses, yellow hat band) - not winged orb, not charcoal silhouette
- Feature cartoon mascot on hero; charcoal detective only if empty / 404 polaroid art still uses it
- Brand wordmark SNITCH dominant on share graphics (editable type, not baked neon)
- Reject SaaS card templates with Inter-style type and pill badges
- Editable design to iterate: `DAHRnszV8hM` (rebuild if it drifts to SaaS or coral)

## NanoGPT brief

Prefer cheap models (Flux Schnell) unless quality fails.

Prompts must say:

- soft risograph print, warm cream paper, charcoal + strong mustard / fluorescent yellow spot inks
- logo mark: cute cartoon detective mascot in white trench coat, black sunglasses, yellow hat-band accent (tight square crop for favicon/nav); not winged orb; not charcoal silhouette; not official Golden Snitch / WB art
- hero illustration: same cartoon mascot (optionally with binoculars); landscape 16:9+ with room for HTML typography; yellow ink floor band
- halftone dots, ink grain, misregistration, flat ink fills, paper show-through
- zine / editorial poster; no neon purple, no coral primary, no glossy 3D, no baked wordmark / gibberish UI

Store logo under `public/images/brand/mascot-mark.png` (tight crop from `public/images/marketing/hero/mascot-character.png`; favicon crops from the mark). Hero source: `mascot-character.png` (+ `mascot-binos.png` for illustration). Marketing under `public/images/marketing/` (`hero.jpg`, `og.jpg`, `empty-404.jpg`). Retired orb asset `snitch-mark.png` and charcoal `detective-mark.png` / `detective.png` may remain on disk; do not use orb or charcoal silhouette in logo chrome.

## Logo vs illustration

- **Logo / favicon**: `mascot-mark.png` - Lovable cartoon mascot left of the Snitch wordmark (`SnitchBrand`, `AppLogo`, `AppLogoIcon`, chrome icons)
- **Hero illustration**: `mascot-character.png` / `mascot-binos.png` peek animation on landing
- **Optional empty / 404**: charcoal detective polaroid art may remain where already used (`detective.png`, marketing JPGs)
- Treatment: soft printed riso, not neon cyber, not photoreal noir, not cloned HP merchandise

## Surface mapping

| Surface | Treatment |
|---|---|
| Landing | Riso poster hero with cartoon mascot peeks; scrap sections below fold |
| Legal / About | Quiet `.snitch-doc` with light halftone |
| Onboarding | Scrap form; polaroid picks with print grade |
| Feed | Printed contact sheet + stamp filters |
| Post detail | Polaroid + ink stickers |
| Winners | Tear-sheet board |
| Competitors | Cutout chips with yellow offset shadow |
| Dashboard | Scrap nav panels |
| Settings | Quieter `.snitch-doc` |
